### RoomToRentRadar.Api — sample requests for US01 / T01.1 (Auth + JWT)
### 1. Start the API in Development (the dev JWT key lives in appsettings.Development.json):
###      $env:ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT = "Development"; dotnet run --project RoomToRentRadar.Api --urls http://localhost:5199
### 2. Click "Send Request" above each request (VS Code "REST Client" extension or Visual Studio).
### 3. Send "Login OK (student)" first: its token is reused by the /me requests below.
### Demo accounts come from IctuSeedData (password 123456).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5199

### Health check (Web API + SQLite) → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Login OK (student) → 200 { accessToken, tokenType, expiresAtUtc, user } (no password hash)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Who am I, with the token from "login" → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Who am I, without a token → 401 "Bạn cần đăng nhập để thực hiện thao tác này."
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Who am I, with a fake token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwicm9sZSI6IkFkbWluIn0.fake-signature

### Login OK (landlord) → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "landlord@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login wrong password → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Login missing fields → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### Register new student → 201 with a token (send twice: the second time → 400, email already used)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sinh viên Thử Nghiệm",
  "email": "sinhvien.test@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "0988000111",
  "role": "Student"
}

### Register landlord (role is case-insensitive) → 201 with a token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Chủ Trọ Thử Nghiệm",
  "email": "chutro.test@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "0912000222",
  "role": "landlord"
}

### Register as Admin is not allowed → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Hacker",
  "email": "admin2@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "0900000000",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Register with a short password → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Mật Khẩu Ngắn",
  "email": "short.pw@ictu.edu.vn",
  "password": "123",
  "phone": "0900000001",
  "role": "Student"
}
